  m_text: "\u2022 Texture maps vary the colour, the smoothness and the normal across the surface.\n\u2022 Real size, on the sphere and on the slab.\n\u2022 Wet: the same floor, smoother and darker.\n\n<size=80%><color=#A8A8A8>Textures: ambientCG and Poly Haven, CC0.</color></size>"
